    <description>Salesforce -&gt; Jira cancellation trigger (Scenario 2). When an Opportunity newly reads Closed Lost with Risk Stage Closed/Churn (the renewal-churn Apex sets both in one save) and its Account is not a test account, publish one deactivation request per product line the Opportunity carries: the line must appear on an Opportunity Product (Integration_Product_Line__c), the Account must hold that line's instance id, and the Opportunity must not already carry a deactivation ticket key for that line. Each request is a registry row plus an Integration_Request__e event, created by the subflow Integration_Publish_Deactivation_Row. Fires on the transition only, and on updates only: the churn is always an update of an existing Renewal Forecast Opportunity, and an Opportunity inserted already churned would have no Opportunity Products yet.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_NeonCrmEligible</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Account.NCRM_Instance__c})), ISBLANK({!$Record.Neon_CRM_Cancellation_JIRA__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_FundraiseEligible</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Account.RB_RB_ID__c})), ISBLANK({!$Record.Fundraise_Cancellation_JIRA__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_ArtsPeopleEligible</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Account.Arts_People_Theatre_Id__c})), ISBLANK({!$Record.Arts_People_Cancellation_JIRA__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_ArtsPeopleInstanceId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.Account.Arts_People_Theatre_Id__c}), "", TEXT(FLOOR({!$Record.Account.Arts_People_Theatre_Id__c})))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Opportunity | Publish Deactivation Request {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Opportunity | After Save | Publish Deactivation Request (Jira Cancellation)</label>
